# Montfort Real Estate (GHL React SPA)

**Read `DOCUMENTATION.md` first.** Then `AGENT-ONBOARDING.md`. Session notes: `PROJECT-CONTEXT.md`. Launch blockers: `HANDOFF.md`.

## Git — `local-root` vs `main` (hard rule)

This workspace stays on **`local-root` forever**. That branch is only a clone/snapshot of the full disk (`ghl-react/` + `reference/`). It is **not** GHL, not production, not the fetch tree.

- **Daily work:** stay on `local-root`. Commit snapshots there only if the owner asks.
- **GHL / GitHub app:** copy **only updated/new app files** from `ghl-react/` onto **`main`**, dropping the `ghl-react/` prefix (`ghl-react/src/App.tsx` → `src/App.tsx`).
- **Never** merge `local-root` into `main` or `main` into `local-root`.
- **Never** push `reference/`, `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `.env`, or the parent workspace layout to `main`.
- **Never** tell the owner “push this checkout to `local-root`” as the way to update GHL. GHL raw URLs are `.../montfortre/main/<path>`.
- Ship `main` via a **feature branch + PR into `main`**, or copy into a separate `main` clone. Do not force-push `main`.
- Do not create a third long-lived branch as a substitute for this split.

When asked what to push to `main`, list **only** changed/new files under `ghl-react/` that belong to the SPA (TS/TSX, CSS, `src/data`, `public/` assets, `App.tsx`, sitemap, GHL paste/URL/tracking docs).

## Frozen

- SEO modules in `src/seo/pages/*.ts` — never edit values. `Seo.tsx` rewrites `https://montfortre.com` via `src/lib/siteOrigin.ts`.
- Copy, phone `(646) 970-1078`, link targets, H1 counts (Two Family has two H1s)
- Desktop ≥1440px pixel-identical; responsive only in `max-width` queries
- Hover is CSS `:hover`. Do not reintroduce `style-hover` attributes. Leave `useStyleHover()` in PageShell as a no-op safety net.

## Architecture

- React 18 + Vite + TypeScript. Not Next.js.
- `src/App.tsx`: `MobileHeader` once above `Routes` — 12 migrated routes + `NotMigrated`
- Each page: `PageShell` + `src/components/<area>/*Content.tsx` + `src/styles/*.css` + `src/seo/pages/*.ts`
- No page-level `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`. No AgentFire CDN.
- Do not put `overflow-x: hidden` on `.site-page`

## Content / branding / SEO

- Copy: content TSX files. Branding: `public/redesign-assets/`. SEO check: matching `src/seo/pages/*.ts`. Sitemap: `public/sitemap.xml`.

